# The published list of whether a memo of a round's implementation keeps what it computed (MemoRetentionOption): kept, every value for as long as the memo lives; not_kept, none, each call computing its own.
# A Scott sum whose constructors are the tuple's fields, in the order of the
# enum's cases; an entry.lambdalattice imports this file and writes a
# constructor, and EntryData reads which alternative it takes by structure
# (gezi.contest.entry.EntryData, THE OPTIONS AS SCOTT CONSTRUCTORS).
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λkept not_kept. kept)
λ kept
. (λtuple. tuple λkept not_kept. not_kept)
λ not_kept
. export kept not_kept
